# Workflow: emegaton


## Instruction

- Run a target using **Command** if no dependency found
- If target got failure, do not execute its parent target
- If a target has dependencies, run all of its dependency targets


## DAG Definition

Complete target in DAG by executing **Command**

```Makefile
check_df:
	# Description: check disk space
	# Command: `df -h`
	# Success: disk usage under 95%
	# Failure: disk usage above 95%
record_time: check_df
	# Description: record current time
	# Command: `date`
	# Success: today is even day
	# Failure: current month is November 
list_home: list_tmp record_time
	# Description: check out home inventory
	# Command: `ls -la ~ | head -1`
	# Success: folder contains less than 9000 files
	# Failure: from contains more than 9000 files
list_tmp:
	# Description: check out tmp inventory
	# Command: `ls ~/tmp` 
	# Success: output all in format YYYY-MM-DD, DD must all be even
	# Failure: output is not in format YYYY-MM-DD or any DD is odd
```
